===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Any of the [[poisonous]] [[umbellifer]]ous [[plant]]s, of the genera
## ''[[Conium]]'', either ''[[Conium maculatum]]'' or {{taxlink|Conium chaerophylloides|species|noshow=1}}.
## ''[[Cicuta]]'', [[water hemlock]] plant.
# The [[poison]] obtained from these ''Conium'' and ''Cicuta'' plants.
# {{senseid|en|Tsuga}} Any of several [[coniferous]] [[tree]]s, of the genus ''[[Tsuga]]'', that grow in [[North America]]; the [[wood]] of such trees.

